Scope

This licence covers the source code of this project only: the recompilers
(tools/, tools/amiga/), the runtime (runtime/), the settings program and
disk image reader (launcher/), the build and install scripts and the
documentation.

It does NOT cover:
- DuckTales: The Quest for Gold itself (the DOS and the Amiga versions), or
  anything made from it (the game files, disk images, the disassembly, the
  generated C code in gen/ or build_tmp/gen/ and any compiled ducktales_dos
  executable). The game is copyright (c) 1990 Disney; it was developed by
  Incredible Technologies.
- Third-party components, which keep their own licences (see licenses/):
  SDL2 (zlib), the SPS decoder library CAPSImg (non-commercial use only),
  font8x8 (public domain).
